  Description: You called the wilderness home as you found trails and guided travelers.
    Your wanderlust could have called you to the adventuring life, or perhaps you
    served as a scout for soldiers and found you liked battle. Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You're trained in the Survival skill and a Lore skill related to one terrain
    you scouted in (such as Forest Lore or Cavern Lore). You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Forager]
    skill feat.
